---

This repository ships no compiler binaries. The COBOL toolchain it loads at
runtime is produced by `seo-rii/wasm-llvm` and is governed by its own licenses:

- GnuCOBOL compiler (`cobc`): GPL-3.0-or-later
- GnuCOBOL runtime library (`libcob`): LGPL-3.0-or-later
- GMP: LGPL-3.0-or-later / GPL-2.0-or-later
- LLVM/Clang: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception

The browser-side host code, `@wasm-idle/llvm-core`, is MIT AND
(Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception).
